<div style="max-width:900px; margin:20px auto; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#292F36;">

<!-- AI-Generated Assignment Design -->
<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">Assignment Generation</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
An 8th-grade ELA teacher uses AI to quickly generate a full argumentative writing assignment, including a prompt, model essay, and rubric. They skim the materials and assign them without making significant revisions, assuming the AI-generated content is ready to use.
<br><br>
As students begin working, issues emerge. The model essay includes weak reasoning, and students treat it as a strong example. The rubric emphasizes structure over argument quality, and the task doesn’t fully align with the intended standards. The assignment is completed, but it doesn’t produce the level of thinking the teacher was aiming for.
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px 24px; background:white; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB;">

<div style="width:340px; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:#FFFFFF; font-size:14px; line-height:1.35; color:#555;">
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">T</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Task & Purpose</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">H</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Human Oversight</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">I</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Instructional Quality</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">N</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>No Sensitive Data</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">K</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Professional Judgment</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
</div>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
<strong>Overall:</strong> AI helped generate materials quickly, but the teacher did not adequately review or revise them. As a result, the assignment lacked instructional rigor, alignment, and the level of thinking students were expected to demonstrate.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<!-- Parent Communication and Privacy -->
<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">Parent Communication</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
A 4th-grade teacher uses AI to draft an email to a parent about ongoing behavioral challenges. To get a more tailored response, they include specific details about recent incidents. The AI generates a clear, professional message, and the teacher sends it with only minor edits.
<br><br>
Afterward, the teacher realizes the tone feels impersonal and doesn’t reflect their relationship with the family. Additionally, they shared more detailed student information with the AI tool than necessary, raising concerns about privacy.
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px 24px; background:white; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB;">

<div style="width:340px; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:#FFFFFF; font-size:14px; line-height:1.35; color:#555;">
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">T</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Task & Purpose</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">H</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Human Oversight</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">I</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Instructional Quality</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">N</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>No Sensitive Data</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">K</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Professional Judgment</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
</div>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
<strong>Overall:</strong> AI supported efficient communication, but sensitive student information was shared unnecessarily and the message was not carefully personalized. The result was a professional-sounding response that introduced privacy concerns and weakened the teacher-family connection.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<!-- Using AI as a Planning Partner -->
<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">Planning Partner</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
A middle school assistant principal is preparing a staff meeting focused on improving student writing. They use AI to generate a draft agenda with discussion questions and suggested strategies. While the output looks polished, it is very general and doesn’t reflect the school’s recent writing data or specific challenges, like supporting multilingual learners.
<br><br>
Before finalizing the agenda, the administrator revises it to include actual student work samples, recent assessment data, and a protocol teachers have already been trained on. They remove generic strategies and replace them with concrete next steps aligned to current school goals.
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px 24px; background:white; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB;">

<div style="width:340px; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:#FFFFFF; font-size:14px; line-height:1.35; color:#555;">
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">T</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Task & Purpose</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">H</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Human Oversight</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">I</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Instructional Quality</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">N</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>No Sensitive Data</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">K</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Professional Judgment</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
</div>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
<strong>Overall:</strong> The administrator used AI appropriately as a starting point rather than a final product. By applying professional judgment and incorporating real school data, the final plan remained relevant, actionable, and aligned to school goals.
</p>
</div>
</details>

<!-- Simplifying Without Oversimplifying -->
<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:10px;">Differentiation</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
A 9th-grade biology teacher uses AI to simplify a reading on cell division for students who need additional support. They distribute the simplified version without reviewing it closely, assuming it maintains the key ideas.
<br><br>
During the lesson, students using the adapted text struggle to use correct vocabulary and explain the process accurately. The AI version removed important terms and oversimplified key concepts, unintentionally lowering the rigor of the task.
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px 24px; background:white; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB;">

<div style="width:340px; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:#FFFFFF; font-size:14px; line-height:1.35; color:#555;">
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">T</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Task & Purpose</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">H</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Human Oversight</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">I</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Instructional Quality</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">N</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>No Sensitive Data</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✔</div></div>
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr 32px;"><div style="background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">K</div><div style="padding:6px 12px;"><strong>Professional Judgment</strong></div><div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;">✖</div></div>
</div>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; color:#555;">
<strong>Overall:</strong> AI was used with a worthwhile goal—making content more accessible—but the output was not reviewed carefully. Important concepts and vocabulary were lost, reducing the rigor of the task and limiting students' access to grade-level learning.
</p>
</div>
</details>

</div>
